  "design": {
    "idea": "The Sling Catapult (ASTONISHING): zero straight lines to the Boss Key citadel; flip Well 2 to Push, orbit your lantern around Well 1 to charge the hidden light sensor retracting the iron shutter, recall, and curve ONE 175-degree S-bend bolt through all three wells and the Blue Prism Relay to deploy the citadel bridge.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Full synthesis of Apogee Clasp orbit, polarity flipping, and multi-well curved Prism shots.",
    "decisions": 10,
    "expert_s": 65,
    "reward": "boss_key_mv+hub_shortcut_3",
    "why": "Climax aha puzzle of The Meteor Vault guarding the Boss Key and Cycle 3 hub return.",
